# Movie API tests (Week 2)
# To repeat the tests: stop the server (Ctrl + C), start it again with "node app.js"
# so that the data is reset to the 5 starting movies, then run the requests.
# Tests 12-22 (filter and sort) were run on the fresh 5 starting movies.

### 1. Get all movies
GET http://localhost:3000/movies

### 2. Get one existing movie
GET http://localhost:3000/movies/1

### 3. Get a missing movie
GET http://localhost:3000/movies/999

### 4. Create a valid movie
POST http://localhost:3000/movies
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Arrival",
  "year": 2016,
  "genre": "Sci-Fi"
}

### 5. Create an invalid movie
POST http://localhost:3000/movies
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "",
  "year": "not a number"
}

### 6. Replace a movie with PUT
PUT http://localhost:3000/movies/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Inception: Updated Edition",
  "year": 2010,
  "genre": "Sci-Fi"
}

### 7. Invalid incomplete PUT
PUT http://localhost:3000/movies/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "The Matrix"
}

### 8. Partially update a movie with PATCH
PATCH http://localhost:3000/movies/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "year": 2011
}

### 9. Invalid PATCH
PATCH http://localhost:3000/movies/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "year": "abc"
}

### 10. Delete an existing movie
DELETE http://localhost:3000/movies/5

### 11. Delete the same movie again
DELETE http://localhost:3000/movies/5

### 12. Filter by genre
GET http://localhost:3000/movies?genre=Sci-Fi

### 13. Filter by genre (lower case, must give the same result)
GET http://localhost:3000/movies?genre=sci-fi

### 14. Filter by minimum year
GET http://localhost:3000/movies?minYear=2000

### 15. Filter by genre and minimum year
GET http://localhost:3000/movies?genre=Sci-Fi&minYear=2000

### 16. Sort by year
GET http://localhost:3000/movies?sort=year

### 17. Sort by title
GET http://localhost:3000/movies?sort=title

### 18. Filter and sort together
GET http://localhost:3000/movies?genre=Sci-Fi&minYear=2000&sort=year

### 19. No movie matches (empty array)
GET http://localhost:3000/movies?genre=Horror

### 20. Invalid minYear
GET http://localhost:3000/movies?minYear=invalid

### 21. Invalid sort value
GET http://localhost:3000/movies?sort=rating

### 22. Original order is unchanged after sorting
GET http://localhost:3000/movies

### 23. Unknown route
GET http://localhost:3000/does-not-exist

### 24. Broken JSON in the request body (error-handling middleware)
POST http://localhost:3000/movies
Content-Type: application/json

{ "title": "Broken movie",